Files copied from the upstream project:

  skills/goldfish/personas/zoom_out.md                   <- agents/zoom_out.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/comprehension.md              <- agents/comprehension.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/design_critic.md              <- agents/design_critic.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/structural.md                 <- agents/structural.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/style.md                      <- agents/style.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/implementation_readiness.md   <- agents/implementation_readiness.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/codebase_details.md           <- agents/codebase_details.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/inventive_catalyst.md         <- agents/inventive_catalyst.md
  skills/goldfish/personas/synthesizer.md                <- agents/synthesizer.md
  skills/goldfish/standards/*.md                         <- resources/document_standards/*.md

Modified files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):

  skills/goldfish/personas/synthesizer.md
    The "Personas Directory" and "Document Standards Directory" lines were
    changed to point to this plugin's personas/ and standards/ directories.

Rewritten (not copied) from upstream workflows:

  skills/goldfish/SKILL.md, skills/goldfish/scripts/goldfish.mjs
    Based on skills/egm-review, skills/egm-review-loop and skills/egm-resolve.
    Interactive checkpoint gates were replaced with a non-interactive flow:
    fixes are applied automatically and only ESCALATE findings are asked.
  skills/drift/SKILL.md, skills/drift/scripts/drift.mjs
    Based on skills/egm-drift-report. A deterministic reference check was
    added in front of the agent's semantic comparison.
